{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00159",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.79,
      "end_seconds": 3.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "Excuse me, doctor, should I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.71,
      "end_seconds": 8.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "So, not at all, please sit. What's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.18,
      "end_seconds": 16.47,
      "duration_seconds": 7.29,
      "text": "Doctor, it's a weak urine stream. It's getting on my nerves now. I've never really been one for hospitals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.97,
      "end_seconds": 23.12,
      "duration_seconds": 5.15,
      "text": "How long has this been going on? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.67,
      "end_seconds": 26.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "It's been going on for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.9,
      "end_seconds": 29.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "And how severe is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.57,
      "end_seconds": 38.42,
      "duration_seconds": 7.85,
      "text": "Maybe a four out of ten on a bad day. Oh, and a feeling that the bladder doesn't empty."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.58,
      "end_seconds": 42.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "So, I'll just check what's already recorded here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.74,
      "end_seconds": 43.59,
      "duration_seconds": 0.85,
      "text": "Please do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.74,
      "end_seconds": 57.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. Any weight loss or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.32,
      "end_seconds": 63.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "I haven't had weight loss or fever, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.59,
      "end_seconds": 70.21,
      "duration_seconds": 5.62,
      "text": "Okay, any burning when passing urine, back pain or blood in the urine at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.75,
      "end_seconds": 77.49,
      "duration_seconds": 6.74,
      "text": "I mean, no, no burning when passing urine, back pain or blood in the urine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.88,
      "end_seconds": 81.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Mm. Okay, how about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.36,
      "end_seconds": 84.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "No, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.52,
      "end_seconds": 88.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Sorry, the computer needs a moment to load this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.9,
      "end_seconds": 89.65,
      "duration_seconds": 0.75,
      "text": "No rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.46,
      "end_seconds": 113.43,
      "duration_seconds": 7.97,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.34,
      "end_seconds": 116.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "No, nothing I'm aware of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.83,
      "end_seconds": 119.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Do you have any questions before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.27,
      "end_seconds": 132.99,
      "duration_seconds": 9.72,
      "text": "Not at the moment, I think you've covered most of what I was wondering. If something comes to mind later, I'll ask you before I leave."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.09,
      "end_seconds": 137.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "Let's go through your medication. What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.23,
      "end_seconds": 140.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "It's, It's tamsulosin, at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.95,
      "end_seconds": 143.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "How much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.15,
      "end_seconds": 146.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "It's 0.4 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.49,
      "end_seconds": 161.57,
      "duration_seconds": 12.08,
      "text": "It's quite normal to feel unsure at this point. People often expect an instant answer, but a good assessment usually has a few stages, and today is mainly about narrowing things down and making a sensible plan together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.89,
      "end_seconds": 164.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "That's reassuring to hear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.78,
      "end_seconds": 168.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Moving on to your background, any past medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.33,
      "end_seconds": 172.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "I've had an enlarged prostate, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.24,
      "end_seconds": 177.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "Let me make a quick note of that before I forget."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.05,
      "end_seconds": 178.75,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.29,
      "end_seconds": 195.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Any operations in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.91,
      "end_seconds": 206.07,
      "duration_seconds": 9.16,
      "text": "Yes, I had my tonsils out, when I was a child. I just want to get back to normal, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.44,
      "end_seconds": 209.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.45,
      "end_seconds": 215.81,
      "duration_seconds": 5.36,
      "text": "Busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.34,
      "end_seconds": 217.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "How about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 218.97,
      "end_seconds": 221.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "No, I don't smoke and never have."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.19,
      "end_seconds": 223.13,
      "duration_seconds": 0.94,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.66,
      "end_seconds": 227.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "I gave up drinking about three years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.8,
      "end_seconds": 241.56,
      "duration_seconds": 12.76,
      "text": "I like to make sure you understand what's happening, so please stop me at any point. There are no silly questions, and I'd much rather you ask now than go home still wondering about something."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 242.43,
      "end_seconds": 244.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "Right, I understand now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.25,
      "end_seconds": 248.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "Is it okay if I type while we talk?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 248.91,
      "end_seconds": 251.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Yes, of course, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.29,
      "end_seconds": 254.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Let me double-check something in your record."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.85,
      "end_seconds": 256.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Of course, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.69,
      "end_seconds": 282.14,
      "duration_seconds": 11.45,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Right, here's what I'm thinking. I think we're dealing with an enlarged prostate causing urinary symptoms at this stage. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 282.54,
      "end_seconds": 284.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Is this going to go away?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.23,
      "end_seconds": 301.78,
      "duration_seconds": 16.55,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like an enlarged prostate causing urinary symptoms, but I'd like to confirm. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had a weak urine stream for two years, and no burning when passing urine or blood in the urine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 302.32,
      "end_seconds": 303.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.36,
      "end_seconds": 308.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "Alright, do you need me to explain anything as we go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 309.5,
      "end_seconds": 315.54,
      "duration_seconds": 6.04,
      "text": "Just tell me in plain language, please. I'm not good with the medical terms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.9,
      "end_seconds": 324.56,
      "duration_seconds": 7.66,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a urine test for urinary symptoms. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 326.02,
      "end_seconds": 329.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "We have a slot Monday at 2 pm, if that works."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 331.02,
      "end_seconds": 357.29,
      "duration_seconds": 26.27,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange kidney function tests for urinary symptoms. Cut back on tea and coffee after the afternoon and go before you sleep. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference. We'll refer you to the urology clinic. Please don't sit on it if the symptoms get worse. That's the point to get seen urgently. Let's review you after the results are back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 358.68,
      "end_seconds": 364.83,
      "duration_seconds": 6.15,
      "text": "So, I want to be sure we're on the same page. How would you describe the plan?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 366.19,
      "end_seconds": 371.3,
      "duration_seconds": 5.11,
      "text": "So, I come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 371.98,
      "end_seconds": 376.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. I think we've covered it. Do you have any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 377.02,
      "end_seconds": 380.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "So, you know, thanks so much, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 381.61,
      "end_seconds": 382.46,
      "duration_seconds": 0.85,
      "text": "Alright, goodbye."
    }
  ]
}